  "description": {
   "en": "Uzurai has always loved cute things since he was a child but realises it’s not “normal” for boys to like cute things. He fell in love with Enaga who also loves cute things and is the only one who knows how he really is but doesn’t want to ruin their friendship. In middle school, Enaga learns of Uzurai's feelings for his classmate Hachimaki, how will this relationship develop?"
